@prefix : <https://example.org/relations#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<https://example.org/relations> a owl:Ontology .

:Top a owl:Class .
:RootA a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Top .
:RootB a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Top .
:Middle a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :RootA, :RootB .
:Leaf a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Middle .
:Instance a owl:NamedIndividual, :Leaf .

:TopProperty a owl:ObjectProperty .
:SubProperty a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:subPropertyOf :TopProperty .

:Cohort a owl:Class .
:ParentCohort a owl:NamedIndividual, :Cohort .
:ChildCohort a owl:NamedIndividual, :Cohort ; :isPartOf :ParentCohort .
:isPartOf a owl:ObjectProperty ; owl:inverseOf :hasPart .
:hasPart a owl:ObjectProperty .
